00:44:55,450 --> 00:45:01,450
[CHORUS]
Hop on one foot, Skip on two; Dance the Spaceman, Howdly-do! Bounce on four foot, Spring on three; Let's be Spacemen,  Howdly-dee!
ໂດດເທິງຕີນດຽວ, ກະໂດດໃສ່ສອງ; ເຕັ້ນຄົນອະວະກາດ, ໂຮດລີ-ເຮັດ!
ກະໂດງໃສ່ຕີນສີ່, ພາກຮຽນ spring ໃນສາມ; ມາເປັນຄົນອະວຸໂສ, ໂຫດລີ - ດີ!

698
00:45:01,950 --> 00:45:07,950
[DINAH]
-- Tab Hunter, Doris Day, out, Jack the Ripper, out, Bing Crosby, Shirley Temple, out, out, Orson Welles, Lucille Ball, out, Marlon Brando, out, Queen Elizabeth, Mickey Mantle, out, out, Yul Bryner, Louis Armstrong, out, Lana Turner, out -- 100.
